  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPast.AtYourQuestion": "[pg]At your question, she looks to the side with a pensive expression. After a moment, she closes her eyes and appears to concentrate deeply on something. [say:I... can't quite remember everything. But at least, I remember feeling very lost. There w-was already something wrong, something... I was wandering the desert, and... and a witch took me in. I remember their magic. I remember feeling good for the first time in a long time. I remember losing myself, slowly.]"
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPast.NowMostlyLucid": "Now that she's mostly lucid, you'd like to ask [bathgirlname] about her past. How exactly did she end up as a slave to the sand witches? What was her life like before that?"
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPast.SheAsks": "[pg][say:Did they do the right thing, [name]?] she asks."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPast.ShiversAndThenSays": "[pg]She shivers, and then says, [say:I'm still grateful to them, but... looking back, I don't know how to feel about what they did to me. They saved me, gave me a life, but... I almost rather they'd...] She shakes her head and opens her eyes, glancing up at you with a great deal of conflict on her face."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPastAnswer.AWorthwhileDream": "[pg]A worthwhile dream."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPastAnswer.ButThatsAboutIt": "[pg]But that's about it, [name]. Still nothing specific, sorry.[sayend] [Bathgirlname] looks down at her feet, folding her hands in her lap. [say:I hope I can find that place again, someday.]"
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPastAnswer.FromSoundOfIt": "From the sound of it, she was in dire straits out in that desert. Whatever the sand witches did, it's the sole reason she's here today, talking to you. Even if she had to suffer in the meantime, she was able to survive to this day, and not everyone gets that."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPastAnswer.NodsNotEntirelyConvinced": "[pg]She nods, not looking entirely convinced. [say:Thanks, [name]. I guess I'll have to think about it more.] She looks up at you and smiles. [say:But I can do that now, because of you. Oh, but there was more to your question, sorry for getting sidetracked there,] she says, abashed. [saystart]Before the desert, right... I don't know much, but I don't think I was from around here. I remember... I remember a calm, quiet place. The trees there were so tall, and the grass was so soft. There was a little house there, a cottage. I was safe. I don't know what took me from that."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPastAnswer.TellHerNoJudge": "You tell her that you can't really judge them without knowing all the details. What seemed right at the time might have had unintended consequences, and you don't even know their reasoning for taking her in at all. It would be presumptuous of you to try to adjudicate, here and now."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkPastAnswer.TheresNoOtherWay": "There's no other way to look at it--what happened to her was a travesty. Slavery is an unambiguous evil, and people shouldn't have their autonomy taken away just because of what others view as \"necessity\". You're just glad you were able to save her from that."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkSlave.BlurtsOutSurprised": "[pg][say:Huh?] she blurts out, evidently surprised. Had she really not thought about this?"
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkSlave.ExplainSinceYouBought": "[pg]You explain that since you bought her, you're [if (cor < 50) {technically }]her [master], but because she wasn't exactly in control of her faculties at that time, you're not sure if she feels any differently than she did back then, or if she has any complaints about her station."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkSlave.SaysSomewhatAbashed": "[pg][say:Ah, right,] she says, somewhat abashed. [say:Um, well, I don't really have any problem with it. You've obviously treated me well--you gave me my life back! If I'd stayed with the witches, who knows what would become of me... But because of you, I have a second chance now.] She smiles, serenely. [say:I trust you, and I trust that you'll keep taking care of me. I'll serve you happily, [Master],] she concludes with a light giggle."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkSlave.WellTheresNoReason": "Well, there's no reason to mince words. You ask [bathgirlname] how she feels about living here [if (cor < 50) {with you|as your property}]."
  "Scenes.Milkwaifu.MilkTalkSlave.WellYoureGlad": "[pg]Well you're glad that's all sorted out."
